  "hypothesis": "G33-HA: blind or subtle faults missing from the USGS/INGENIOUS catalogue express as a conjunction of (a) near-vertical potential-field contacts (tilt angle band 6 tc ~ 0), (b) strong gravity horizontal-gradient edges (band 18 iso_grav_anom_hg) and (c) preserved linear surface breaks (LiDAR scarp coherence lid_coh100 and step response lid_step_max).",
